      "value": "Did a really messy mock-up of how to merge them into one page. They'd be dropdowns or buttons that open up a screen/page. Top is the regular default one for choosing the instance type, below that would be selecting if the instance is Age Verified or not, bottom is for the new moderation settings for prints, drones, etc.. A [ ] Save Default checkbox would be on THIS screen, on the bottom, to save all four states at once, and a Join Instance button..",
